<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/logo.svg">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#ffffff">
<title>Does This Steam Game Use AI? Check AI Disclosures | Game AI Checker</title>
<meta name="description" content="See if a Steam game uses generative AI. Search 120+ games for the developer's AI disclosure, the exact quote, player reports and human-made claims.">
<link rel="canonical" href="https://gameaichecker.com/">
<meta property="og:type" content="website">
<meta property="og:site_name" content="Game AI Checker">
<meta property="og:title" content="Does This Steam Game Use AI? Check AI Disclosures | Game AI Checker">
<meta property="og:description" content="See if a Steam game uses generative AI. Search 120+ games for the developer's AI disclosure, the exact quote, player reports and human-made claims.">
<meta property="og:url" content="https://gameaichecker.com/">
<meta property="og:image" content="https://gameaichecker.com/og-home.png">
<meta property="og:image:type" content="image/png">
<meta property="og:image:width" content="1200">
<meta property="og:image:height" content="630">
<meta property="og:image:alt" content="Game AI Checker — Steam AI disclosures and source-backed game records">
<meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image">
<meta name="twitter:title" content="Does This Steam Game Use AI? Check AI Disclosures | Game AI Checker">
<meta name="twitter:description" content="See if a Steam game uses generative AI. Search 120+ games for the developer's AI disclosure, the exact quote, player reports and human-made claims.">
<meta name="twitter:image" content="https://gameaichecker.com/og-home.png">
<meta name="twitter:image:alt" content="Game AI Checker — Steam AI disclosures and source-backed game records">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Schibsted+Grotesk:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{
  --paper:#f4f6f9;--surface:#ffffff;--ink:#142033;--ink-soft:#4a5870;--muted:#6b778c;--line:#dfe5ee;--line-strong:#c4cedc;
  --blue:#1f6feb;--blue-deep:#1655bf;--blue-wash:#e8f0fe;
  --amber:#a15c00;--amber-wash:#fdf1dc;--green:#1d7a46;--green-wash:#e2f5e9;
  --slate:#5b677a;--slate-wash:#eef1f5;--violet:#6a3fc7;--violet-wash:#efe9fc;
  --radius-lg:22px;--radius:14px;--radius-sm:9px;
  --font:"Schibsted Grotesk",ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,"Segoe UI",sans-serif;
}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%}
body{margin:0;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);font-family:var(--font);font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
a{color:var(--blue)}
img{max-width:100%}
:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #7fb0ff;outline-offset:2px;border-radius:6px}
.wrap{width:min(1180px,100% - 32px);margin-inline:auto}
.sr-only{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;padding:0;margin:-1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0,0,0,0);white-space:nowrap;border:0}
.skip{position:absolute;left:12px;top:-60px;z-index:100;background:var(--ink);color:#fff;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none}
.skip:focus{top:10px}

/* ---------- Navigation ---------- */
.nav{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:50;background:rgba(255,255,255,.92);backdrop-filter:saturate(1.4) blur(10px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:saturate(1.4) blur(10px);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.nav-inner{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:22px;height:64px}
.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;color:var(--ink);text-decoration:none;font-weight:800;font-size:1.06rem;letter-spacing:-.02em;white-space:nowrap;flex-shrink:0}
.brand img{width:36px;height:29px}
.brand b{color:#1f8fff;font-weight:800}
.nav-links{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:2px;margin:0;padding:0;list-style:none}
.nav-links a{display:block;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:.92rem;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap}
.nav-links a:hover{color:var(--ink);background:var(--slate-wash)}
.nav-links a[aria-current="page"]{color:var(--ink)}
.nav-search{flex:1;display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;min-width:0}
.nav-search form{display:flex;align-items:center;width:min(300px,100%);height:40px;border:1px solid var(--line-strong);border-radius:10px;background:var(--surface);padding:0 4px 0 12px;opacity:0;visibility:hidden;transform:translateY(-4px);transition:opacity .18s ease,transform .18s ease,visibility .18s}
.nav.show-search .nav-search form{opacity:1;visibility:visible;transform:none}
.nav-search form:focus-within{border-color:var(--blue);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px var(--blue-wash)}
.nav-search svg{flex-shrink:0;color:var(--muted)}
.nav-search input{flex:1;min-width:0;border:0;background:transparent;font:inherit;font-size:.9rem;color:var(--ink);padding:0 8px}
.nav-search input:focus{outline:none}
.nav-cta{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:40px;padding:0 15px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--ink);color:#fff;font-size:.88rem;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap;flex-shrink:0}
.nav-cta:hover{background:#24324a}
.menu-btn{display:none;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:42px;height:42px;margin-left:auto;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;background:var(--surface);color:var(--ink);cursor:pointer}
.menu-btn svg{display:block}.menu-btn .i-close,.nav.open .menu-btn .i-open{display:none}.nav.open .menu-btn .i-close{display:block}

/* ---------- Hero / search ---------- */
.hero{padding:clamp(10px,1.6vw,20px) 0 clamp(16px,2vw,24px);text-align:center}
.hero h1{margin:0 auto;max-width:15ch;font-size:clamp(2.6rem,7vw,5.1rem);line-height:.98;letter-spacing:-.048em;font-weight:900;text-wrap:balance}
.hero-sub{margin:12px auto 0;max-width:56ch;color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:clamp(1rem,1.7vw,1.15rem)}
.hero-sub strong{color:var(--ink);font-weight:700}

.finder{position:relative;max-width:820px;margin:22px auto 0;text-align:left}
.finder-box{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;height:76px;padding:0 9px 0 24px;background:var(--surface);border:2px solid var(--ink);border-radius:var(--radius-lg);box-shadow:0 1px 0 var(--ink),0 22px 50px -24px rgba(20,32,51,.45);transition:border-color .15s ease,box-shadow .15s ease}
.finder-box:focus-within{border-color:var(--blue);box-shadow:0 0 0 5px var(--blue-wash),0 22px 50px -24px rgba(31,111,235,.5)}
.finder-box>svg{flex-shrink:0;color:var(--ink)}
.finder-box input{flex:1;min-width:0;height:100%;border:0;background:transparent;font:inherit;font-size:clamp(1.02rem,2vw,1.28rem);color:var(--ink);padding:0 12px}
.finder-box input::placeholder{color:#8a95a8}
.finder-box input:focus{outline:none}
.finder-box input::-webkit-search-cancel-button{display:none}
.finder-clear{display:none;width:36px;height:36px;border:0;border-radius:50%;background:transparent;color:var(--muted);cursor:pointer;font-size:1.3rem;line-height:1}
.finder-clear:hover{background:var(--slate-wash);color:var(--ink)}
.finder.has-value .finder-clear{display:block}
.finder-go{height:56px;padding:0 26px;border:0;border-radius:15px;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font:inherit;font-size:1.02rem;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap}
.finder-go:hover{background:var(--blue-deep)}
.finder-kbd{display:inline-grid;place-items:center;min-width:26px;height:26px;margin-right:6px;border:1px solid var(--line-strong);border-radius:6px;color:var(--muted);font-size:.8rem;font-weight:600}
.finder.has-value .finder-kbd{display:none}

.suggest{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;top:calc(100% + 8px);z-index:30;margin:0;padding:6px;list-style:none;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line-strong);border-radius:16px;box-shadow:0 24px 60px -20px rgba(20,32,51,.35);max-height:min(430px,60vh);overflow:auto}
.suggest[hidden]{display:none}
.suggest li{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:13px;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:11px;cursor:pointer}
.suggest li[aria-selected="true"],.suggest li:hover{background:var(--blue-wash)}
.suggest .thumb{width:84px;aspect-ratio:460/215;flex-shrink:0;border-radius:6px;background:var(--slate-wash) center/cover no-repeat}
.suggest .s-main{flex:1;min-width:0}
.suggest .s-name{display:block;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}
.suggest .s-dev{display:block;color:var(--muted);font-size:.84rem;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}
.suggest .s-empty{display:block;padding:12px 10px;color:var(--ink-soft);cursor:default}
.suggest .s-empty:hover{background:none}
.suggest .s-all{justify-content:center;color:var(--blue);font-weight:700;font-size:.92rem;border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:0 0 11px 11px;margin-top:4px}

.try{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin:18px auto 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem}
.try button{border:1px solid var(--line-strong);background:var(--surface);color:var(--ink-soft);border-radius:999px;padding:6px 13px;font:inherit;font-size:.86rem;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer}
.try button:hover{border-color:var(--ink);color:var(--ink)}
.note{margin:14px auto 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:.86rem}

/* ---------- Status chips ---------- */
.chip{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:3px 9px 3px 8px;border-radius:999px;font-size:.76rem;font-weight:700;line-height:1.5;white-space:nowrap}
.chip::before{content:"";width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:currentColor}
.chip.disclosed{background:var(--amber-wash);color:var(--amber)}
.chip.human{background:var(--green-wash);color:var(--green)}
.chip.unreviewed{background:var(--slate-wash);color:var(--slate)}
.chip.community{background:var(--violet-wash);color:var(--violet)}
.chip.noevidence{background:var(--blue-wash);color:var(--blue-deep)}

/* ---------- Browser (tabs + grid) ---------- */
.browser{padding:8px 0 20px;scroll-margin-top:80px}
.tabs{display:flex;gap:6px;overflow-x:auto;scrollbar-width:none;padding:4px 2px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);margin-bottom:22px}
.tabs::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none}
.tab{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-shrink:0;height:40px;padding:0 15px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;background:var(--surface);color:var(--ink-soft);font:inherit;font-size:.92rem;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer}
.tab:hover{border-color:var(--line-strong);color:var(--ink)}
.tab[aria-selected="true"]{background:var(--ink);border-color:var(--ink);color:#fff}
.tab .count{font-size:.8rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--muted)}
.tab[aria-selected="true"] .count{color:#b7c2d4}
.browser-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:16px;margin-bottom:16px}
.browser-head h2{margin:0;font-size:clamp(1.3rem,2.4vw,1.65rem);letter-spacing:-.03em}
.browser-head p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem}
.query-pill{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;margin-left:10px;padding:3px 6px 3px 11px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--blue-wash);color:var(--blue-deep);font-size:.84rem;font-weight:600;vertical-align:middle}
.query-pill button{border:0;background:transparent;color:inherit;cursor:pointer;font-size:1rem;line-height:1;padding:2px 4px}

.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(250px,1fr));gap:16px}
.game{display:flex;flex-direction:column;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);overflow:hidden;color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
.game:hover{border-color:var(--ink)}
.game:hover h3{text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px}
.game-art{position:relative;aspect-ratio:460/215;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#e7ecf3,#d9e1ec)}
.game-art img{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}
.game-art .fallback{position:absolute;inset:0;display:grid;place-items:center;padding:12px;color:var(--slate);font-weight:800;font-size:1.05rem;text-align:center;letter-spacing:-.02em}
.game-body{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;padding:13px 15px 15px;flex:1}
.game h3{margin:0;font-size:1rem;line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-.01em}
.game .dev{margin:-4px 0 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:.84rem;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}
.game .meta{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:6px;margin-top:auto}
.game .event{color:var(--muted);font-size:.76rem;font-weight:600}
.more{display:flex;justify-content:center;margin-top:24px}
.more button{height:46px;padding:0 24px;border:1px solid var(--ink);border-radius:12px;background:var(--surface);color:var(--ink);font:inherit;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}
.more button:hover{background:var(--ink);color:#fff}
.empty{padding:36px 24px;border:1px dashed var(--line-strong);border-radius:var(--radius);background:var(--surface);text-align:center}
.empty h3{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:1.15rem}
.empty p{margin:0 auto 14px;max-width:48ch;color:var(--ink-soft)}
.empty .actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;gap:10px}
.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:42px;padding:0 16px;border-radius:10px;font-weight:700;font-size:.92rem;text-decoration:none}
.btn.primary{background:var(--blue);color:#fff}
.btn.primary:hover{background:var(--blue-deep)}
.btn.ghost{border:1px solid var(--line-strong);color:var(--ink)}
.btn.ghost:hover{border-color:var(--ink)}

/* ---------- Human-made ---------- */
.section{padding:clamp(40px,6vw,64px) 0 0}
.section-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:end;gap:20px;margin-bottom:18px}
.section-head h2{margin:0;font-size:clamp(1.45rem,2.8vw,2rem);letter-spacing:-.035em;line-height:1.1}
.section-head p{margin:6px 0 0;max-width:60ch;color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:.95rem}
.human-section{padding:clamp(8px,2vw,16px) 0 clamp(36px,5vw,52px);scroll-margin-top:80px}
.human-band{background:#dff3e6;border:1px solid #bfe3cc;border-radius:26px;padding:clamp(20px,3.4vw,36px)}
.human-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-end;gap:18px 40px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:clamp(18px,2.6vw,26px)}
.slogan{margin:0;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:baseline;gap:0 .32em;font-size:clamp(2.6rem,7.4vw,5.4rem);font-weight:900;line-height:.92;letter-spacing:-.055em}
.slogan-ai{color:var(--ink)}
.slogan-human{color:#137a3f}
.human-side{max-width:40ch}
.human-side p{margin:0 0 12px;color:#2f4a3a;font-size:.93rem}
.human-all{height:42px;padding:0 16px;border:1px solid #137a3f;border-radius:11px;background:#137a3f;color:#fff;font:inherit;font-size:.92rem;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}
.human-all:hover{background:#0e6232;border-color:#0e6232}
.human-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(min(100%,240px),1fr));gap:14px}
.human-grid .game{border-color:#bfe3cc}
.human-grid .game:hover{border-color:#137a3f}
/* ---------- Method scale ---------- */
.scale{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(6,1fr);gap:0;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);overflow:hidden;background:var(--surface)}
.scale li{padding:16px 16px 18px;border-left:1px solid var(--line);position:relative}
.scale li:first-child{border-left:0}
.scale li::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;right:0;top:0;height:5px;background:var(--lvl)}
.scale .lvl{display:block;font-size:1.9rem;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-.04em;line-height:1;margin:8px 0 8px}
.scale .desc{display:block;color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:.86rem;line-height:1.4}
.scale-note{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px 28px;margin:16px 0 0;color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:.9rem}
.scale-note p{margin:0;max-width:62ch}

/* ---------- Footer ---------- */
.foot{margin-top:clamp(56px,8vw,88px);padding:28px 0 40px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--muted);font-size:.86rem}
.foot-inner{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px 32px}
.foot nav{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px 18px}
.foot a{color:var(--ink-soft);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}
.foot a:hover{color:var(--ink);text-decoration:underline}
.foot p{margin:0;max-width:60ch}

/* ---------- Responsive ---------- */
@media (max-width:1020px){
  .nav-search{display:none}
  .nav-inner{justify-content:space-between}
  .scale{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}
  .scale li:nth-child(4){border-left:0}
  .scale li:nth-child(n+4){border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
}
@media (max-width:860px){
  .menu-btn{display:inline-flex}
  .nav-cta{display:none}
  .nav-menu{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;top:64px;background:var(--surface);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);box-shadow:0 18px 30px -18px rgba(20,32,51,.3);padding:8px 16px 16px;display:none}
  .nav.open .nav-menu{display:block}
  .nav-links{flex-direction:column;align-items:stretch;gap:0}
  .nav-links a{padding:13px 4px;font-size:1rem;border-radius:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
  .nav-menu .nav-cta{display:flex;justify-content:center;margin-top:14px;height:46px}
}
@media (min-width:861px){.nav-menu{display:contents}.nav-menu .nav-cta{display:none}}
@media (max-width:600px){
  .finder-box{height:62px;padding:0 6px 0 16px;border-radius:17px}
  .finder-box>svg{width:20px;height:20px}
  .finder-go{height:48px;padding:0 16px;border-radius:12px;font-size:.95rem}
  .finder-kbd{display:none}
  .grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:10px}
  .game-body{padding:10px 11px 12px;gap:6px}
  .game h3{font-size:.9rem}
  .game .dev{font-size:.78rem}
  .chip{font-size:.7rem}
  .browser-head{flex-direction:column;gap:4px}
  .section-head{flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start}
  .scale{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}
  .scale li:nth-child(odd){border-left:0}
  .scale li:nth-child(4){border-left:1px solid var(--line)}
  .scale li:nth-child(n+3){border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
  .suggest .thumb{width:64px}
  .human-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:10px}
  .human-side{max-width:none}
}

@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){html{scroll-behavior:auto}.nav-search form,.finder-box{transition:none}}

/* Human-made showcase cards are intentionally label-free. */
#human-made .human-grid .game-body .meta,
#human-made .human-grid .game-body .chip { display: none !important; }
.browser-head h2{margin-right:auto}
.browse-link{font-size:.9rem;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap}
.browse-link:hover{text-decoration:underline}
</style>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/airy-site.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/toolfavor-cta.css" />
</head>
<body>
<a class="skip" href="#q">Skip to search</a>

<header class="nav" id="nav">
  <div class="wrap nav-inner">
    <a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="Game AI Checker home"><img src="/logo.svg" alt="" width="36" height="29"><span>Game <b>AI</b> Checker</span></a>
    <button class="menu-btn" id="menuBtn" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="navMenu" aria-label="Open menu">
      <svg class="i-open" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 6h14M3 10h14M3 14h14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg><svg class="i-close" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m5 5 10 10M15 5 5 15" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
    </button>
    <div class="nav-menu" id="navMenu">
      <nav aria-label="Main">
        <ul class="nav-links">
          <li><a href="/browse/">Browse games</a></li>
          <li><a href="/indie-ai/">Indie AI</a></li>
          <li><a href="/events/steam-next-fest-october-2026/">Next Fest</a></li>
          <li><a href="/guides/how-to-check-steam-game-ai/">How to check</a></li>
          <li><a href="/#method">How we rate</a></li>
          <li><a href="/games/" lang="zh-CN" hreflang="zh-CN">中文</a></li>
        </ul>
      </nav>
      <div class="nav-search">
        <form id="navForm" role="search" aria-label="Search games from the navigation bar">
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="8.5" cy="8.5" r="6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/><path d="m13 13 4.5 4.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
          <input id="navQ" type="search" placeholder="Search a game" aria-label="Search a game" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off">
        </form>
      </div>
      <a class="nav-cta" href="/browse/">Browse all games</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<main id="main">
  <section class="hero wrap">
    <h1>Does this Steam game use AI?</h1>
    <p class="hero-sub" id="heroSub">Tracking <strong>199 Steam games</strong>, 104 with an official AI disclosure. Search one to see what its developer has said and the evidence behind it.</p>

    <form class="finder" id="finder" role="search" autocomplete="off">
