":"5391500-ardhan","appId":"5391500","name":"Ardhan","developer":"Ștefan Mihai Șerb","status":"official_disclosure","statusLabel":"官方 AI 披露","statusTone":"amber","summary":"Steam 开发者披露：独立开发者在生成式 AI 工具协助下制作本作。卡牌、英雄、背景和过场美术由 Higgsfield 平台上的图像模型生成，商店主视觉、短动画片段、九种语言的旁白、部分音乐和许多音效由 AI 模型（含 ElevenLabs）生成，再由开发者挑选、裁剪和编辑；游戏运行时不生成内容、没有 AI 聊天、不向 AI 服务发送数据。","releaseDate":"Oct 26, 2026","releaseYear":"2026","genres":["Roguelike"],"event":null,"areaKeys":["art","music","voice","marketing"],"areaSummary":"美术 / 视觉（已披露使用）、音乐与音效（已披露使用）、配音（已披露使用）、营销素材（已披露使用）","header":"/images/steam/apps/5391500/5a0a74e2e9d6bdb4.webp?v=gallery1","steamUrl":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/5391500/","reviewedAt":"2026-10-23","hasStatic":true},{"slug":"4159680-barfender-co-op-bar-simulator","appId":"4159680","name":"Barfender: CO-OP Bar Simulator","developer":"Proto Division","status":"official_disclosure","statusLabel":"官方 AI 披露","statusTone":"amber","summary":"1 至 4 人合作酒吧模拟，2026 年 10 月 12 日上市。开发者披露生成式 AI 只用于旁白/配音流程并征得配音演员同意，另外 Steam 胶囊宣传图用到 AI 生成内容；同时强调视觉素材与玩法内容全部由团队和外部美术制作。","releaseDate":"Oct 12, 2026","releaseYear":"2026","genres":["Indie","Simulation","Early Access"],"event":null,"areaKeys":["voice","marketing"],"areaSummary":"配音（已披露使用）、营销素材（已披露使用）","header":"/images/steam/apps/4159680/156ae2cbae244bc7.webp?v=gallery1","steamUrl":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/4159680/","reviewedAt":"2026-11-03","hasStatic":true},{"slug":"5073550-bat-flapper","appId":"5073550","name":"Bat Flapper","developer":"Dark Cave Games","status":"official_disclosure","statusLabel":"官方 AI 披露","statusTone":"amber","summary":"扮演蝙蝠在黑暗洞穴中飞行、以吃发光虫补充声呐的 3D 街机跑酷游戏。 Steam 开发者披露：部分贴图（textures）借助生成式 AI 工具制作，随后经开发者审阅与编辑；部分音频素材借助生成式 AI 工具制作，随后经开发者审阅与编辑；未区分音乐与音效。其他领域未被披露提及。","releaseDate":"即将推出（未定日期）","genres":["Action"],"event":"Steam Next Fest October 2026","areaKeys":["art","music"],"areaSummary":"美术 / 视觉（已披露使用）、音乐与音效（已披露使用）","header":"/images/steam/apps/5073550/bc3f30cb371f1532.webp?v=gallery1","steamUrl":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/5073550/","reviewedAt":"2026-10-24","hasStatic":true},{"slug":"1331550-big-ambitions","appId":"1331550","name":"Big Ambitions","developer":"Hovgaard Games","status":"official_disclosure","statusLabel":"官方 AI 披露","statusTone":"amber","summary":"城市建设与经商模拟。开发者披露 AI 只用于把游戏翻译成更多语言，并用“Nothing else is AI”总括其余内容；3D 模型、动画与游戏内音乐均称由真人完成，音乐经 Artlist 授权。","releaseDate":"Aug 28, 2026","releaseYear":"2026","genres":["Indie","Simulation"],"event":null,"areaKeys":["translation"],"areaSummary":"本地化 / 翻译（已披露使用）","header":"/images/steam/apps/1331550/2be457356aaafac2.webp?v=gallery1","steamUrl":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/1331550/","reviewedAt":"2026-10-30","hasStatic":true},{"slug":"5000870-breathbound","appId":"5000870","name":"BreathBound","developer":"SanShineStudios","status":"official_disclosure","statusLabel":"官方 AI 披露","statusTone":"amber","summary":"1 至 4 人合作恐怖游戏，靠呼吸与声音管理躲避追踪。开发者以独立开发者身份披露，为完成游戏内容使用了部分 AI 生成美术素材。","releaseDate":"Coming soon（计划；核查时尚未发售）","genres":["Action","Adventure","Indie"],"event":null,"areaKeys":["art"],"areaSummary":"美术 / 视觉（已披露使用）","header":"/images/steam/apps/5000870/1cc380ebd5fd5010.webp?v=gallery1","steamUrl":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/5000870/","reviewedAt":"2026-10-31","hasStatic":true},{"slug":"5212940-bunker-tidy-up","appId":"5212940","name":"Bunker Tidy Up","developer":"Tovarishch Games","status":"official_disclosure","statusLabel":"官方 AI 披露","statusTone":"amber","summary":"地堡整理模拟。开发者披露 AI 用于制作 Steam 页面宣传素材；讨论区有玩家指更新后的结局图片也是 AI 生成、披露已不准确，但无开发者回应。","releaseDate":"23 Sep, 2026","releaseYear":"2026","genres":["Casual","Simulation"],"event":null,"areaKeys":["marketing"],"areaSummary":"营销素材（已披露使用）","header":"/images/steam/apps/5212940/21d6b592723be1bb.webp?v=gallery1","steamUrl":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/5212940/","reviewedAt":"2026-10-30","hasStatic":true},{"slug":"4930450-card-reversi","appId":"4930450","name":"Card Reversi","developer":"okkeiji","status":"official_disclosure","statusLabel":"官方 AI 披露","status